{["source"]="https://thegaminjosh.blogspot.com/2018/08/eq1-heros-journey-boawbs-jealosy.html",["facts"]="Both delivery routes, keywords, belt/mask and cash rewards. Later walkthrough corroboration."},{["source"]="https://tawnyowl.seesaa.net/article/25688421.html",["published"]="2006-10-18",["facts"]="Contemporary confirmation of Love in the Air chain and amulet, Boawb/Reakash rewards."},{["source"]="local PEQ tasks/items/npc_types queried 2026-10-27",["facts"]="Exact item and NPC IDs; existing Oh Brother reward fields retained."}},["dialogue"]={{["npc"]=394078,["keywords"]={"wallow"},["text"]="I cannot find the courage to tell Kamilah how I feel. Will you help deliver a gift?"},{["npc"]=394017,["keywords"]={"council","plan"},["text"]="My brother is on the council instead of me. I have an elixir I want you to deliver to Reakash. Ask me to deliver it if you are willing."}},["question_chains"]={{["npc"]=394142,["task"]=6020,["stage"]=2,["bucket"]="achievement_quest.myjinn.answers",["requires_items"]={84218,84219,84220},["questions"]={{["answer"]="nokk",["prompt"]="What was the name of the ogre city that stood here?"},{["answer"]="plane of earth",["prompt"]="Which plane did the war god invade before his creations were cursed?"},{["answer"]="human race",["prompt"]="Which mortal race becomes drakkin through the touch of a dragon?"}},["missing_text"]="Bring the three works, read the enchanted parchment, and study them before answering."},{["npc"]=394256,["task"]=3003673,["stage"]=2,["bucket"]="achievement_quest.heshyrr.yuvill",["requires_see_invisible"]=true,["questions"]={{["answer"]="bound",["prompt"]="Ask why Gekkdar is bound to this place."},{["answer"]="past",["prompt"]="Ask about the amulet’s past."},{["answer"]="properties",["prompt"]="Ask about the amulet’s properties."},{["answer"]="ogre",["prompt"]="Ask about the ogre chief."},{["answer"]="protected",["prompt"]="Ask how the amulet protected him."},{["answer"]="symbol",["prompt"]="Ask what Gekkdar remains a symbol of."}},["missing_text"]="Use the spiritstaff or another source of See Invisible to speak with Yuvill."}},["world"]={["task"]=3003673,["staff"]=84221,["listen_radius"]=40,["listen_height"]=20,["speech_interval_seconds"]=8,["idle_despawn_seconds"]=45,["timing_policy"]="Configurable server pacing and proximity tolerances; original speech timing/radius is unverified.",["spirits"]={{["npc"]=394900,["name"]="Spirit_of_Truth",["controller"]=394902,["activity"]=0,["loc_yxz"]={-588.27,142.57,-12.29},["source_date"]="2006-09-24",["source_url"]="https://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/npc.html?id=22607",["lines"]={"An answer about tomorrow can change the choices made today.","A virtuous dragon learned its future and grew proud.","Its final choices changed the outcome it had been shown.","Seek understanding beyond your own desires and expectations.","The natural world also offers reliable lessons to careful observers.","Knowledge can inspire kindness or anger; choose its purpose carefully.","Carry these lessons forward and continue seeking honestly."}},{["npc"]=394901,["name"]="Spirit_of_Wisdom",["controller"]=394903,["activity"]=1,["loc_yxz"]={-886.09,-1268.01,-158.97},["source_date"]="2009-02-05",["source_url"]="https://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/quest.html?quest=3673",["lines"]={"Wisdom continues to grow when the learner keeps an open mind.","A fixed purpose can hide important details about an adversary.","Notice your emotions and learn what they reveal about experience.","Instinct supplies another kind of guidance alongside deliberate thought.","Each experience adds tools for understanding the world around you.","Consider what lies beneath words, stories and instruction as you continue."}}},["mist"]={["controller"]=394904,["task"]=3004203,["activity"]=3,["loc_yxz"]={-1642,-2387,-218},["radius"]=35,["height"]=30,["input"]=84204,["output"]=84203,["source_url"]="https://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/quest.html?quest=4203",["source_date"]="2008-02-27",["z_source"]="2021 report plus